  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 13pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> </span> has released a notification for the recruitment of <strong>Havildar Instructor&nbsp;posts</strong> on the official website of UPSSSC. This recruitment has been issued for <strong data-start=\"890\" data-end=\"903\">209 posts</strong>. The online application process for UPSSSC Havildar Instructor Recruitment 2026 will start from<strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1003\"> 19 June 2026</strong>, and candidates can apply <strong data-start=\"1030\" data-end=\"1053\">until 09 July 2026</strong>. Candidates must check the complete details for UPSSSC Havildar Instructor Recruitment 2026 <strong data-start=\"1137\" data-end=\"1152\">given below</strong>.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UPSSSC Havildar Instructor Recruitment 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">UPSSSC Advt No:- 11 Exam 2026</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>19 June 2026</strong></spa